<title>BELGIUM: Belgian bankruptcies down 5.7 pct in Sept yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Belgian bankruptcies down 5.7 pct in Sept yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company bankruptcies in Belgium totalled 608 in September, down 5.7 percent from 645 in the year-ago month, company data group Dun &amp; Bradstreet said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The biggest bankruptcy, based on turnover figures published by 107 out of the 608 companies, was  International Antwerpse Handelsmaatschappij in Antwerp.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
